                                                "sense_id": "c6f7cec7-a640-3eb1-b0f9-c5b95939a1d0",
                                                "text": "Other unpredictables, like the recent unexpected blizzards and those of 2 years ago, or a hurricane can cost us many thousands of dollars, and have a severe impact on equipment and facilities."
                                            }
